    <p class="content-note">Saily prices by the gigabyte; Yesim prices by the day or by a rollover dollar balance (from $1.10/GB on Pay &amp; Fly). The numbers above aren't directly comparable units, but Saily lands cheaper across every destination in this snapshot, which tracks with Saily sitting in our "Cheap" price bracket and Yesim in "Expensive."</p>
